.TH SMFLAT 1
.SH NAME
smflat \- write the flat pattern of a part as DXF
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B smflat \-f dxf
.I part.st
.SH DESCRIPTION
.I Smflat
writes the unfolded blank of a part as DXF on the standard output,
in mm.
The stream
.RI ( stream (5))
must hold one folded part.
Layer OUTLINE holds the cut contour, with true arcs and circles;
layer BEND holds a center line for each bend zone.
Each coat
.RI ( sm (5))
draws its region, cut to the box of the blank, on the layer
.BI COAT_NEAR_ material
or
.BI COAT_FAR_ material
of its side and its material.
.SH SEE ALSO
smfold(1), stream(5)
